{"id":"memorial_101702","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101700","label":"Memoirs · Letters from Girlfriend"},"label":"To J,","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101701","next":"memorial_101703","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101702_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"I got your letter."},{"id":"memorial_101702_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"Robotic aliens? If you're going to lie to me,"},{"id":"memorial_101702_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"you could at least come up with something better than that."},{"id":"memorial_101702_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"Anyway, I'm doing well, so don't worry about me."},{"id":"memorial_101702_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"If what you told me is true, I should leave this place at once. Anywhere else would be better than here..."},{"id":"memorial_101702_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"Could you give me more details in your next letter?"},{"id":"memorial_101702_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_02_description","text":"Hurry up and get your phone fixed. I want to hear your voice. Love you♡"}]}